{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55686","headline":"句 四 · 延寿","name":"句 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草浓春径狭，树密晚窗阴。\n（均见明刻本《吟窗杂录》卷三十二《古今诗僧》。\n）（按：延寿卒於开宝八年，时吴越虽已奉宋爲正朔，用其年号，而仍维持独立。\n吴越纳土，爲延寿卒後三年之事。\n诸书或以延寿爲宋人，实未谛。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}